      "source": "Repository fragment to provide methods to retrieve entities using the pagination and sorting abstraction. This an\nextension to <a href=\"PagingAndSortingRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a> returning <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> instead of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> where applicable.",
      "translation": "提供使用分页和排序抽象检索实体的方法的存储库片段。这是 <a href=\"PagingAndSortingRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a> 的扩展，在适用情况下返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 而不是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
